# 20 mm cube, OBJ vertex colours (v x y z r g b): top four vertices red, bottom four blue.
# Written for the orcaslicer-wasm texture module tests (Orca's vertex-colour route: the colours are
# quantized and the side faces split along the red/blue boundary).
v -10 -10 0 0.05 0.10 0.85
v 10 -10 0 0.05 0.10 0.85
v 10 10 0 0.05 0.10 0.85
v -10 10 0 0.05 0.10 0.85
v -10 -10 20 0.90 0.08 0.08
v 10 -10 20 0.90 0.08 0.08
v 10 10 20 0.90 0.08 0.08
v -10 10 20 0.90 0.08 0.08
f 1 3 2
f 1 4 3
f 5 6 7
f 5 7 8
f 1 2 6
f 1 6 5
f 2 3 7
f 2 7 6
f 3 4 8
f 3 8 7
f 4 1 5
f 4 5 8
